---
import Page from '../../layouts/Page.astro';
import CoverageMap from '../../components/CoverageMap.astro';
import { REGIONS, hoodsIn, hoodUrl, hoodTravel, isMoreRegion } from '../../data/areas';
---

<Page title="Areas We Cover – Handyman in Chelsea, Kensington, Fulham & London | Fettle London" description="Handyman and home maintenance across London – Chelsea, Fulham, Kensington, Hampstead, Islington, Wimbledon, Dulwich, Canary Wharf, Kingston and more. No travel charge.">
  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="wrap">
      <p class="eyebrow">Areas we cover</p>
      <h1>Close to home, mostly.</h1>
      <p class="lede">We’re based in Chelsea, SW10. From the King’s Road out to Highgate, Canary Wharf and Sutton, it’s the same small team – and never a travel charge.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="page-body">
    <div class="wrap">
      <CoverageMap id="cov-hub" caption="Tap any dot to see that neighbourhood. Drag and zoom to look around." />

      {REGIONS.map((r) => (
        <>
        {r.slug === REGIONS.find((x) => isMoreRegion(x.slug))?.slug && (
          <div class="area-section prose" style="max-width:none;margin-bottom:8px">
            <h2 style="font-family:var(--font-display);font-weight:800;font-size:clamp(26px,3.4vw,36px);margin:0 0 14px">More areas</h2>
            <p>Further out, the same small team and still no travel charge – from Muswell Hill and Hampstead to Dulwich, Canary Wharf, Kingston and Sutton. For homes more than about 9 miles from our base, we book work as half-days or longer.</p>
          </div>
        )}
        <section class="region-block">
          <header>
            <div>
              <h2>{r.name}</h2>
              <p>{r.lede}</p>
            </div>
            <a href={`/areas/${r.slug}`}>All of {r.name} →</a>
          </header>
          <div class="hood-grid">
            {hoodsIn(r).map((h) => {
              const t = hoodTravel(h);
              return (
                <a class="hood-card" href={hoodUrl(h)}>
                  <span class="pc">{h.postcodes.join(' · ')}</span>
                  <h3>{h.name}</h3>
                  <div class="meta"><span>{t.miles} miles · <b>no travel charge</b></span><span class="go">→</span></div>
                </a>
              );
            })}
          </div>
        </section>
        </>
      ))}

      <div class="area-section prose" style="max-width:none">
        <h2 style="font-family:var(--font-display);font-weight:800;font-size:clamp(26px,3.4vw,36px);margin:0 0 14px">And the places in between</h2>
        <p>Not listed? We also look after homes in Chiswick, Acton, Ealing, Marylebone, Fitzrovia, Bloomsbury, the City and plenty more – still with no travel charge, and no Congestion Charge passed on. Pop your postcode in the map above, or just ask.</p>
        <p style="margin-top:24px"><a class="btn primary" href="/contact">Check your postcode</a></p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Page>
